WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,100
Brother Tu is the third spiritual master.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,100
Kicked away

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,980
What kind of strength does Junior Brother Chu have?

4
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:08,140
And it seems that Junior Brother Chu hasn’t used his spiritual power yet.

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,020
Too fierce

6
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,820
What are you two still doing?

7
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:18,050
Why don't you hurry up and fight?

8
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,120
Brother apprentice

9
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,560
Getting tired so quickly

10
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:27,720
Like this

11
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:32,080
But is it difficult for the disciples who set an example for all the fellow disciples to lose to this one?

12
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,600
Junior Brother Chu who just joined the sect not long ago

13
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,920
I usually rely on my own three-level cultivation to drag me to death.

14
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,440
I'm so embarrassed now

15
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:39,040
Master Zhou

16
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,720
i want you to die

17
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,360
Brother apprentice

18
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:47,720
This is because you don’t practice martial arts and use your spiritual power first.

19
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,800
Not giving up yet

20
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,400
Don't be proud of yourself

21
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,220
If he can stand the fight

22
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,430
You can't even touch a piece of me

23
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:55,550
Disciple

24
00:00:55,550 --> 00:00:56,550
Almost ready

25
00:00:56,550 --> 00:00:57,910
Disciple brother's position of management

26
00:00:57,910 --> 00:00:59,710
He was appointed by the Qiyu Detonator of Yaoyuan

27
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:00,790
Offended Master Qi

28
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:02,230
It will be difficult for you in Yaoyuan

29
00:01:02,230 --> 00:01:04,590
Now I know it's too late to be afraid

30
00:01:04,590 --> 00:01:06,590
You will be kicked out of the garden within three days

31
00:01:06,590 --> 00:01:07,850
You don't believe it

32
00:01:07,850 --> 00:01:09,290
A guy from a poor village

33
00:01:09,290 --> 00:01:12,390
What powerful backer can I have?

34
00:01:12,390 --> 00:01:13,780
Within three days

35
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:15,420
I'll let you get out of the garden first
